            "review_title": "Review at Mango - A German Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rhonda M\n6 contributions\n0\nTerrible food, extremely poor service and over priced\nJan 2024 • Couples\nWe had the worst meal and experience here during our travel around Vietnam. I ordered the Than Hon Chien (Breaded fried pork escalope with German fryed potato. What I received was very over cooked dried out cold pork schnitzel with cold dried out french fries. I’ve had a much better feed at McDonald’s. when I asked our waiter about the my meal displayed in their menu, he replied “that is for display purposes only”. The service was extremely poor at best. Please see the menu photo! Nothing like what I received. Mango Restaurant and Wine Hanoi was also overpriced.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 16, 2024",
