            "review_text": "BrothersTravels\n164 contributions\n0\nDinner before catching train\nSep 2018 • Friends\nWe decided to eat at the Mango Hotel Restaurant as it is located right next to Hanoi Train Station and we were catching a train later that night so wanted to be close by. The food and service were great, we had a beef, chilli and lemongrass stir fry with rice and a beef stir fry with noodles and a side dish of spring rolls.\nWritten September 22, 2018",
